              <tr><td>Búsqueda</td><td>SearXNG → searx.be</td></tr>
              <tr><td>Hooks</td><td>session-memory · command-logger</td></tr>
            </table>
            <div style="margin-top:13px;background:rgba(0,0,0,.25);border:1px solid var(--bdr);border-radius:8px;padding:11px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.71rem;color:var(--blue2);line-height:1.9;">
              $ tmux new -s valy<br>$ openclaw<br><span style="color:var(--muted);"># en TUI:</span> talk to agent
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="ch"><div class="ct">🧭 Ranger · Exploración</div><span class="badge b-ok">Online</span></div>
          <div class="cb">
            <table class="st">
              <tr><td>Modelo</td><td>Groq llama-3.3-70b-versatile</td></tr>
              <tr><td>Fallback 1</td><td>Gemini 2.5 Flash</td></tr>
              <tr><td>Fallback 2</td><td>Qwen 32b</td></tr>
              <tr><td>Fallback 3</td><td>Groq Compound</td></tr>
              <tr><td>Workspace</td><td>workspace-ranger/</td></tr>
              <tr><td>Costo</td><td>Free tier (Groq + Gemini)</td></tr>
              <tr><td>Rol</td><td>Exploración de modelos</td></tr>
            </table>
            <div style="margin-top:12px;padding:11px;background:rgba(34,208,138,.05);border:1px solid rgba(34,208,138,.18);border-radius:9px;font-size:.77rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.55;">
              ✅ Ranger opera completamente con modelos <strong style="color:var(--green);">gratuitos</strong>. Nemotron 120B descartado (inválido OpenRouter). Groq seleccionado como principal.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="ch"><div class="ct">🔧 Maton.ai · Google Suite</div><span class="badge b-ok">Activo</span></div>
          <div class="cb">
            <div class="sys-row">
              <div class="si"><span class="si-icon">📧</span><span class="si-lbl">Gmail</span><span class="badge b-ok">Conectado</span></div>
              <div class="si"><span class="si-icon">📅</span><span class="si-lbl">Calendar</span><span class="badge b-ok">Conectado</span></div>
              <div class="si"><span class="si-icon">📁</span><span class="si-lbl">Drive</span><span class="badge b-ok">Conectado</span></div>
              <div class="si"><span class="si-icon">📄</span><span class="si-lbl">Docs</span><span class="badge b-ok">Conectado</span></div>
            </div>
            <div style="margin-top:12px;padding:11px;background:rgba(66,133,244,.07);border:1px solid rgba(66,133,244,.22);border-radius:9px;font-size:.77rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.55;">
              🔧 Maton.ai gestiona la suite Google completa: envío/lectura de emails, creación de eventos, gestión de archivos en Drive y documentos colaborativos.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card mb14">
        <div class="ch"><div class="ct">📊 Comparativa de Agentes</div></div>
        <div class="cb">
          <table class="st" style="width:100%;">
            <tr style="background:rgba(63,147,255,.06);">
              <td style="font-weight:700;color:var(--txt);">Agente</td>
              <td style="font-weight:700;color:var(--txt);">Rol</td>
              <td style="font-weight:700;color:var(--txt);">Modelo Principal</td>
              <td style="font-weight:700;color:var(--txt);">Costo</td>
              <td style="font-weight:700;color:var(--txt);">Canal</td>
            </tr>
            <tr><td style="color:var(--txt);">🐾 Valy</td><td>Principal</td><td>deepseek-v4-flash</td><td style="color:var(--yellow);">~$0.14/M tok</td><td>Telegram</td></tr>
            <tr><td style="color:var(--txt);">🧭 Ranger</td><td>Exploración</td><td>Groq llama-3.3-70b</td><td style="color:var(--green);">Gratis</td><td>OpenClaw</td></tr>
            <tr><td style="color:var(--txt);">🔧 Maton.ai</td><td>Google Suite</td><td>Google APIs</td><td style="color:var(--green);">Gratis</td><td>Gmail/Drive</td></tr>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ══════ INFRA ══════ -->
    <div class="section" id="s-infra">
      <div class="g2 mb14">
        <div class="card">
          <div class="ch"><div class="ct">💻 pc.valy · Servidor Principal</div><span class="badge b-ok">Operativo</span></div>
