      <div class="card mb14">
        <div class="ch"><div class="ct">🛠️ Pendientes de Instalación</div></div>
        <div class="cb">
          <div class="sys-row">
            <div class="si"><span class="si-icon">🦙</span><span class="si-lbl">Ollama</span><span class="si-val">llama3.2:3b · modelo local</span><span class="badge b-pend">Pendiente</span></div>
            <div class="si"><span class="si-icon">🔒</span><span class="si-lbl">Tailscale VPN</span><span class="si-val">Acceso externo · pc.valy + ZBook + iPad</span><span class="badge b-pend">Pendiente</span></div>
            <div class="si"><span class="si-icon">💻</span><span class="si-lbl">OpenCode.ai</span><span class="si-val">Agente de coding IA</span><span class="badge b-pend">Pendiente</span></div>
            <div class="si"><span class="si-icon">📦</span><span class="si-lbl">Node.js 24</span><span class="si-val">Prerrequisito Claude Code</span><span class="badge b-pend">Pendiente</span></div>
