      <div class="sec-alert err">
        <div class="sec-alert-icon">🔴</div>
        <div><div class="sec-alert-lbl">Telegram Bot Token — Revocar</div>
          <div class="sec-alert-txt"><strong>@BotFather</strong> → /mybots → Valy_bot → API Token → Revoke current token. Actualizar en openclaw.json.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card mb14" style="margin-top:16px;">
        <div class="ch"><div class="ct">📁 Archivo .env.secrets (chmod 600)</div></div>
        <div class="cb">
          <div class="code-block">
            <span style="color:var(--muted);"># /home/valy/.env.secrets</span><br>
            <span style="color:var(--muted);"># chmod 600 ~/.env.secrets</span><br><br>
            DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=<span style="color:var(--yellow);">sk-nueva-key</span><br>
            OPENROUTER_API_KEY=<span style="color:var(--yellow);">sk-or-nueva-key</span><br>
            TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=<span style="color:var(--yellow);">nuevo-token</span>
          </div>
          <div style="margin-top:11px;padding:10px;background:rgba(34,208,138,.05);border:1px solid rgba(34,208,138,.18);border-radius:8px;font-size:.77rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6;">
            ✅ Una key por servicio &nbsp;·&nbsp; ✅ Nunca compartir en chats &nbsp;·&nbsp; ✅ Rotar cada 90 días &nbsp;·&nbsp; ✅ Nunca subir a GitHub
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div><!-- /content -->
